#: ../../source/quickstart.md:1 1da98b5e52fa41ee9c54f274c7e8845b
msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Quick start"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:3 ff726a94fedb47508957715c2f870d71
msgid "这页只做一件事：从安装到生成第一批候选结构。跑通以后，再去看完整清洗流程和每张卡片的参数。"
msgstr ""
"This page takes you from installation to a first set of candidate "
"structures. Once that path works, continue with the full cleaning "
"workflow and the parameter reference for individual cards."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:5 a4093e7f1bdd40d5b6b842c88447246f
msgid ""
"如果软件已经能正常启动，你只是想查某个页面的按钮或参数，不必从头阅读本页，直接进入 "
"[功能指南](module/index.rst)。功能指南按桌面软件页面顺序组织。"
msgstr ""
"If the application already starts normally and you only need to look up a"
" button or parameter, you do not need to read this page from the "
"beginning. Go straight to the [Feature Guide](module/index.rst), which "
"follows the order of the desktop interface."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:8 2f9b76087d11489399b52c4e4593562b
msgid "1. 安装"
msgstr "1. Install NepTrainKit"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:10 7a9ac6763d5a4dcfb4ec2569b7e70cde
msgid "建议使用独立环境，Python 版本用 3.10 到 3.13。"
msgstr "Use an isolated environment with Python 3.10 through 3.13."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:12 d2f28ee54cc8404c8c1fcc330cb58605
msgid ""
"conda create -n nepkit python=3.10\n"
"conda activate nepkit\n"
"pip install NepTrainKit\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:18 07a344f2cd9844f188ee135373b09128
msgid ""
"NepTrainKit 会安装独立的 `nep-adapters` 运行时。macOS 和 Windows wheel 提供 CPU；Linux "
"x86_64 wheel 同时提供 CPU 和 CUDA。安装 wheel 不要求本机安装 CUDA Toolkit 或 NVCC，但 CUDA "
"计算需要兼容的 NVIDIA 驱动。"
msgstr ""
"NepTrainKit installs the separate `nep-adapters` runtime. The macOS and "
"Windows wheels provide CPU support, while the Linux x86_64 wheel provides"
" both CPU and CUDA. Installing a wheel does not require a local CUDA "
"Toolkit or NVCC, but CUDA calculations require a compatible NVIDIA "
"driver."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:20 f41805d2589e432bac46245416164f65
msgid "安装后先确认运行时状态："
msgstr "Confirm the runtime status after installation:"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:22 3cef2bc2086645688bb94a05c422d5ed
msgid ""
"python -c \"import nep_adapters as n; print(n.backend_status('cpu')); "
"print(n.backend_status('cuda'))\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:26 e76418b5e48f4da98b8a76b9e1e26a2c
msgid ""
"如果 `cuda` 显示不可用，NepTrainKit 的 `Auto` 模式（`设置` → `NEP 后端`）会说明原因并使用 "
"CPU。只有在必须使用 CUDA 时才明确选择 `CUDA`；不可用时程序会直接报错。"
msgstr ""
"If `cuda` is unavailable, NepTrainKit's `Auto` mode (`Settings` → `NEP "
"Backend`) explains why and uses the CPU. Select `CUDA` explicitly only "
"when CUDA is required; if it is unavailable, the application reports an "
"error."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:28 e5b1a9292fcf4a39bc784a741325242a
msgid "启动软件："
msgstr "Launch the application:"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:30 fa4f9d4f49864d9381bb9ac008103d18
msgid "nepkit\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:34 04e7599497bd44ef88c1846c37fbfa59
msgid ""
"不想配置 Python 环境的 Windows 用户，也可以从 [GitHub Releases](https://github.com"
"/aboys-cb/NepTrainKit/releases) 下载 "
"`NepTrainKit.windows-x86_64.zip`，解压后直接运行 `NepTrainKit.exe`。"
msgstr ""
"Windows users who prefer not to set up Python can download "
"`NepTrainKit.windows-x86_64.zip` from [GitHub "
"Releases](https://github.com/aboys-cb/NepTrainKit/releases), extract it, "
"and run `NepTrainKit.exe`."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:38 f5d151d9cd054a7399a3f684afb22081
msgid "界面语言默认跟随系统，可以在 `设置` → `语言` 中切换，重启后生效。本文档按中文界面的按钮名称编写； 使用英文界面时，请切换到英文文档对照。"
msgstr ""
"The interface language follows the system by default; change it under "
"`Settings` → `Language` and restart. This documentation uses the English "
"interface labels; if you use the Chinese interface, switch to the Chinese"
" documentation."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:41 108c62f0cc6244e689e1b0a5e00110ea
msgid "2. 打开「构建数据集」页面"
msgstr "2. Open the Make Dataset page"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:43 c399305a42994448ab66e309778d301c
msgid ""
"第一次建议从 `构建数据集` 开始。它的职责是制作训练集候选结构：输入一批基础结构， "
"选择一张或多张卡片，生成应变、扰动、缺陷、表面、掺杂或磁性构型。"
msgstr ""
"For your first run, start with `Make Dataset`. Its role is to create "
"candidate structures for a training set: load a group of base structures,"
" choose one or more cards, and generate strained, perturbed, defective, "
"surface, doped, or magnetic configurations."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:46 7d4be8ad4d3741f487c6a9912db67fa6
msgid ""
"切到 `构建数据集` 后，先点击窗口顶部的 `打开` 按钮导入初始结构。这里的初始结构 通常是已经弛豫好的 "
"`xyz`、`extxyz`、`POSCAR` 或 `CIF` 文件；后面的卡片都会以这批结构 作为输入继续生成候选构型。"
msgstr ""
"After switching to `Make Dataset`, click `Open` at the top of the window "
"to import the starting structures. These are usually relaxed `xyz`, "
"`extxyz`, `POSCAR`, or `CIF` files. The cards that follow use this set of"
" structures as their input and generate candidate configurations."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:50 049d1cb7f8f94d258dd5f0bd8ac1378e
msgid "构建数据集空白工作区"
msgstr "Empty Make Dataset workspace"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:50 049d1cb7f8f94d258dd5f0bd8ac1378e
msgid ".. image:: _static/image/generated/make_data_empty.png"
msgstr ".. image:: _static/image/generated/make_data_empty.png"

