msgid "图中标出了四个位置："
msgstr "The screenshot marks four areas:"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:50 b2f777239a7744faa19513a3054dd215
msgid "编号"
msgstr "No."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:50 53f724d0a4634d47873bf3711c3ee8ba
msgid "图中标注"
msgstr "Label in the screenshot"

