#: ../../source/quickstart.md:50 e500fced6d2c4388843c8e0d0c0b8e86
msgid "添加卡片"
msgstr "Add new card"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:50 dcdec5d59a77494ab0fcb3826dadf2b4
#
msgid "`添加新卡片` 按钮，添加构型生成或筛选卡片。"
msgstr "The `Add new card` button; adds a structure-generation or filtering card."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:50 77c2a02bbf6a4ad6ab752df70044f7ca
msgid "③"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:50 ca37738633604f4fae8d52dfc388a604
msgid "运行选中卡片"
msgstr "Run selected cards"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:50 22ceb6ce25564c46a03c68aa99eefdb4
#
msgid "顶部 `运行` 按钮，只运行已勾选的卡片。"
msgstr "The top `Run` button; runs only the checked cards."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:50 969c05da62294aa7b505062f3e3d0829
msgid "④"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:50 df150fbed30b4f82922d14afda0762b6
msgid "卡片检查器"
msgstr "Card inspector"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:50 a7096deeb7a84bdf86389fc5d2a9fe7e
msgid "右侧区域，查看和修改当前选中卡片的参数与说明。"
msgstr "Right panel for viewing and editing the selected card's parameters and help."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:64 651068146f864f2abcfd6dc15b17d61d
#
msgid "导入初始结构用的是窗口顶部的 `打开` 按钮（图中未标出）。没有输入结构时，多数生成卡片没有可处理的对象。"
msgstr "Import starting structures with the `Open` button at the top of the window (not marked in the screenshot). Most generation cards have nothing to process until an input has been loaded."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:66 5bfb50eda23943a69929edbe29a20acf
msgid "3. 生成一组候选结构"
msgstr "3. Generate a candidate set"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:68 f1a248d0067e42cea7a1566bb8cca0bc
msgid ""
"这里用“晶格应变（`Lattice Strain`）”作为第一张卡。它的输入是已有结构，输出是一组晶格被拉伸或压缩后的结构。 "
"这一步得到的是候选结构，不是最终训练集。"
msgstr ""
"We use “Lattice Strain” as the first card. It takes existing structures "
"as input and outputs structures with expanded or compressed cells. The "
"result is a candidate set, not the final training set."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:71 9e2eac23c7df4949a2abbcbec6d7ec43
msgid "先用 `打开` 导入初始结构。"
msgstr "Import a starting structure with `Open`."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:72 e500fced6d2c4388843c8e0d0c0b8e86
msgid "点击 `添加新卡片`。"
msgstr "Click `Add new card`."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:73 64856d0947654ba995402bb841676562
msgid "选择“晶格应变（`Lattice Strain`）”。"
msgstr "Choose “Lattice Strain”."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:74 2eaa186598ab479dabd653d5fe8815b7
msgid "设置一个小范围，例如 X/Y/Z 都从 `-2%` 到 `2%`，步长 `1%`。"
msgstr ""
"Use a small initial range, for example `-2%` to `2%` along X, Y, and Z "
"with a `1%` step."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:75 7855578e110d4d35abf92f3dbffa07ec
msgid "勾选这张卡，点击顶部 `运行`。"
msgstr "Select the card and click `Run` in the title bar."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:76 b03db02c091f44f199b9d447c85d2114
msgid "运行完成后，从卡片上的导出按钮保存结果。"
msgstr "When the run finishes, save the result with the export button on the card."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:78 8cf1cb49f1d94fbea58f2339af4e0166
msgid "晶格应变卡片快速上手"
msgstr "Lattice Strain card quick start"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:78 8cf1cb49f1d94fbea58f2339af4e0166
msgid ".. image:: _static/image/generated/make_data_lattice_strain.png"
msgstr ".. image:: _static/image/generated/make_data_lattice_strain.png"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:83 ed32f707793e441fa76b96dd7e72308a
msgid "这张图对应的使用逻辑是："
msgstr "Here is the logic behind this workflow:"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:85 b494b3f7ec014c23ac8e524995899665
msgid "先添加卡片，不要一开始就改很多高级参数。"
msgstr "Add the card first; do not begin by changing every advanced option."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:86 d33f783882f74d699918cf056f0fe7b0
msgid "只改与物理目标直接相关的范围，例如应变轴、最小值、最大值、步长。"
msgstr ""
"Change only the ranges tied directly to the physical objective, such as "
"the strain axes, minimum, maximum, and step."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:87 cf8d9455bf4442a0ace62bbb932c7a43
msgid "运行后先看输出数量是否符合预期，再导出到下一步检查。"
msgstr ""
"Check that the output count is plausible before exporting the structures "
"for inspection."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:89 afc85b05fe4e4d1ba20bfcaf08570768
msgid "4. 检查候选结构"
msgstr "4. Inspect the candidates"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:91 4a434cf98d144be3875b774d76881633
msgid "`构建数据集` 生成的是候选结构，不建议默认直接送 DFT。最短检查路径是："
msgstr ""
"`Make Dataset` produces candidate structures, which should not normally "
"be sent directly to DFT. The shortest inspection path is:"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:93 6ddf1f9306b443a284ad2a460763dee0
msgid "NEP 数据集查看总览"
msgstr "NEP Dataset Display overview"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:93 6ddf1f9306b443a284ad2a460763dee0
msgid ".. image:: _static/image/generated/show_nep_overview.png"
msgstr ".. image:: _static/image/generated/show_nep_overview.png"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:98 b972fda58dd844a6bc5ed392884e4957
msgid "点击左侧导航中的 `NEP 数据集查看`，再点击顶部 `打开` → `打开文件…`，选择上一步导出的 `xyz` 文件。"
msgstr ""
"Click `NEP Dataset Display` in the left navigation, then click `Open` → "
"`Open File…` at the top and choose the `xyz` file exported in the "
"previous step."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:100 16ff7cc1de1a4a9bafd7487381f828aa
msgid "先看左侧散点图里的离群点，点中后在右侧结构区确认是否有原子重叠或明显破碎。"
msgstr ""
"Look for outliers in the scatter plots on the left; click one and check "
"the structure view on the right for overlapping atoms or broken "
"structures."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:101 75b3bce7b79d4a09a258b479723c282e
msgid "选中异常结构后点击工具栏 `删除选中项`；需要留档时先用 `保存` → `导出已选择结构` 单独保存。"
msgstr ""
"Select abnormal structures and click `Delete selected items` on the "
"toolbar; to keep a record, first save them with `Save` → `Export "
"Selected`."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:102 5bfda11b83c74c3caaefdffa2745a15a
msgid "清洗完成后，用 `保存` → `导出当前保留结构（N）…` 保存干净的候选池。若随后做 FPS 代表性采样，用 `导出已选择结构（N）…` 保存选中的子集。"
msgstr ""
"After cleaning, save the clean candidate pool with `Save` → `Export Active (N)…`. "
"If you then run FPS representative sampling, save the selected subset with "
"`Export Selected (N)…`."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:104 3ced385a78a6403aab1d9abb0ad33571
msgid "5. 进入 DFT 和训练"
msgstr "5. Continue to DFT and training"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:106 88a22b556c9544b0b582fa0faec94e84
msgid "清洗后的结构再送去做第一性原理计算。DFT 标注完成后，用 GPUMD 训练 NEP； 训练结束后，再回到 `NEP 数据集查看` 查看训练误差。"
msgstr ""
"Send the cleaned structures to first-principles calculations. Once DFT "
"labels are available, train the NEP model with GPUMD. Return to `NEP "
"Dataset Display` after training to inspect the errors."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:109 b840604f74d34a0bb7875d4a8a23c1bb
msgid ""
"完整的清洗顺序、为什么不要先 FPS、以及如何用 NEP 预测做预筛，见 [候选结构清洗后再进入 DFT](workflows/clean-"
"candidate-structures.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [Clean candidate structures before DFT](workflows/clean-candidate-"
"structures.md) for the complete order of operations, why FPS should not "
"come first, and how to use NEP predictions for prescreening."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:112 449a6856a24d477986d7fa4a0134bc41
msgid ""
"如果你在做缺陷、表面、掺杂或磁性结构，直接去看 [构建数据集卡片手册](module/make-dataset-"
"cards/index.md)。手册按卡片用途组织，比逐个试菜单更快。"
msgstr ""
"If you are creating defect, surface, doped, or magnetic structures, go "
"directly to the [Make Dataset card manual](module/make-dataset-"
"cards/index.md). It is organized by purpose, which is faster than trying "
"cards one by one from the menu."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:114 00c2f8d2478747d4b23f25424f351bd0
msgid ""
"手头没有初始结构时，可以先用 [晶体原型构建](module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-"
"prototype-builder-card.md) 卡片从 `fcc`、`bcc`、`hcp` 等标准原型开始。"
msgstr ""
"If you have no starting structure, begin from a standard `fcc`, `bcc`, or"
" `hcp` prototype with the [Crystal Prototype Builder](module/make-"
"dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md) card."

